#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:705 carousel-editor.js:705
msgid "Carousel"
msgstr "Carrousel"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:709 carousel-editor.js:709
msgid "Enable carousel"
msgstr "Activer le carrousel"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:715 carousel-editor.js:715
msgid ""
"Carousel is enabled. The number of visible columns is detected automatically "
"from the gallery settings."
msgstr ""
"Le carrousel est activé. Le nombre de colonnes visibles est détecté "
"automatiquement à partir des réglages de la galerie."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:720 carousel-editor.js:720
msgid ""
"Carousel is enabled. Columns scroll horizontally with responsive navigation."
msgstr ""
"Le carrousel est activé. Les colonnes défilent horizontalement avec une "
"navigation responsive."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:735 carousel-editor.js:735
msgid ""
"Carousel is enabled. Configure the column count or minimum width in the grid "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Le carrousel est activé. Configurez le nombre de colonnes ou la largeur "
"minimale dans les réglages de la grille."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:739 carousel-editor.js:739
msgid "Carousel is enabled. Items scroll horizontally."
msgstr "Le carrousel est activé. Les éléments défilent horizontalement."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:743 carousel-editor.js:743
msgid ""
"Enable to convert this block into a carousel with navigation. You can then "
"choose Manual mode (column count) or Auto mode (minimum column width)."
msgstr ""
"Activez pour convertir ce bloc en carrousel avec navigation. Vous pourrez "
"ensuite choisir le mode Manuel (nombre de colonnes) ou le mode Auto (largeur "
"minimale de colonne)."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:750
msgid "Mobile only"
msgstr "Mobile uniquement"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:764 carousel-editor.js:764
msgid ""
"Carousel is active only on mobile (< 782px). Desktop displays standard "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Le carrousel est actif uniquement sur mobile (< 782px). Sur ordinateur, la "
"mise en page normale est affichée."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:768 carousel-editor.js:768
msgid "Carousel is active on all screen sizes."
msgstr "Le carrousel est actif sur toutes les tailles d'écran."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:776 carousel-editor.js:776
msgid "Display navigation arrows"
msgstr "Afficher les flèches de navigation"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:783 carousel-editor.js:783
msgid "Navigation arrows are visible on the carousel."
msgstr "Les flèches de navigation sont visibles sur le carrousel."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:787 carousel-editor.js:787
msgid "Arrows are hidden. Users can navigate via swipe or scroll."
msgstr ""
"Les flèches sont masquées. Les utilisateurs peuvent naviguer par balayage ou "
"défilement."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:795 carousel-editor.js:795
msgid "Display pagination markers"
msgstr "Afficher les indicateurs de pagination"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:802 carousel-editor.js:802
msgid "Pagination markers are displayed below the carousel."
msgstr "Les indicateurs de pagination sont affichés sous le carrousel."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:806 carousel-editor.js:806
msgid "Pagination markers are hidden for a cleaner layout."
msgstr ""
"Les indicateurs de pagination sont masqués pour une mise en page plus épurée."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:816 carousel-editor.js:816
msgid "Markers layout & style"
msgstr "Disposition & style des indicateurs"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:822 carousel-editor.js:822
msgid "Markers style"
msgstr "Style des indicateurs"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:846 carousel-editor.js:846
msgid "Markers alignment"
msgstr "Alignement des indicateurs"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:871 carousel-editor.js:871
msgid "Enable loop"
msgstr "Activer le mode boucle"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:878 carousel-editor.js:878
msgid ""
"The carousel will loop infinitely, returning to the first slide after the "
"last."
msgstr ""
"Le carrousel défilera en boucle infinie, revenant à la première diapositive "
"après la dernière."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:882 carousel-editor.js:882
msgid "Loop is disabled. The carousel stops at the end."
msgstr "Le mode boucle est désactivé. Le carrousel s'arrête à la fin."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:890 carousel-editor.js:890
msgid "Force stop on each slide (Snap Stop)"
msgstr "Arrêt forcé sur chaque diapositive (Snap Stop)"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:897 carousel-editor.js:897
msgid ""
"Scrolling will stop on every slide, preventing users from skipping multiple "
"slides at once."
msgstr ""
"Le défilement s'arrêtera à chaque diapositive, empêchant les utilisateurs de "
"sauter plusieurs diapositives à la fois."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:901 carousel-editor.js:901
msgid "Users can swipe past multiple slides quickly."
msgstr ""
"Les utilisateurs peuvent faire défiler plusieurs diapositives rapidement."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:909 carousel-editor.js:909
msgid "Enable autoplay"
msgstr "Activer la lecture automatique (Autoplay)"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:916 carousel-editor.js:916
msgid "The carousel will automatically scroll through slides."
msgstr "Le carrousel fera défiler automatiquement les diapositives."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:920 carousel-editor.js:920
msgid "Autoplay is disabled. Users must navigate manually."
msgstr ""
"La lecture automatique est désactivée. Les utilisateurs doivent naviguer "
"manuellement."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:928 carousel-editor.js:928
msgid "Autoplay delay (ms)"
msgstr "Délai de lecture automatique (ms)"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:937 carousel-editor.js:937
msgid "Time in milliseconds between each slide transition."
msgstr "Temps en millisecondes entre chaque transition de diapositive."

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:947 carousel-editor.js:947
msgid "Arrow style & position"
msgstr "Style & position des flèches"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:961 carousel-editor.js:961
msgid "Arrow Design"
msgstr "Design des flèches"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:998 carousel-editor.js:998
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:1003 carousel-editor.js:1003
msgid "Arrow offset (px)"
msgstr "Décalage des flèches (px)"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:1019 carousel-editor.js:1019
msgid "Arrow colors"
msgstr "Couleurs des flèches"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:1025 carousel-editor.js:1025
msgid "Arrow color"
msgstr "Couleur des flèches"

#: assets/js/carousel-editor.js:1030 carousel-editor.js:1030
msgid "Arrow background color"
msgstr "Couleur d'arrière-plan des flèches"

